{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setUser:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"userId"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"emails:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSArray","text":"NSArray"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"emails"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The custom user identifier."}]}],"name":"userId"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Array of email address strings to associate with the user."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"emails"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Convenience method that combines ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setUserId:"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"setEmails:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" into a single"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"server request. This is more efficient than calling both methods separately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and ensures atomic association of user ID with emails."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this during login or registration flows when you have both user ID"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and email available simultaneously."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Complete registration with user ID and emails:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class RegistrationManager {","","    func completeRegistration(_ registration: RegistrationData) {","        \/\/ Create user on backend","        APIClient.shared.createUser(registration) { result in","            guard case .success(let user) = result else { return }","","            \/\/ Set both user ID and emails in single operation","            var emails = [user.email]","            if let secondaryEmail = registration.secondaryEmail {","                emails.append(secondaryEmail)","            }","","            Pushwoosh.configure.setUser(user.id, emails: emails)","","            \/\/ Set initial user tags","            Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","                \"registration_date\": ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: Date()),","                \"registration_source\": registration.source.rawValue,","                \"account_type\": user.accountType.rawValue,","                \"has_completed_onboarding\": false","            ])","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["   when you need confirmation."]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"setUser:emails:","roleHeading":"Type Method","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setUser:emails:"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setUser:emails:","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setUser:emails:"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setUser:emails:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setuser:emails:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Sets user identifier and emails together in a single operation.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"title":"PWConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setUser:emails:":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets user identifier and emails together in a single operation."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setUser:emails:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setUser:emails:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setUser:emails:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"setUser:emails:","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setuser:emails:","kind":"symbol"}}}